@api = http://localhost:5000

### API hoạt động -> 200
GET {{api}}/

### Danh sách bài tập -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### Nộp hợp lệ -> 201
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"assignmentId":1,"studentCode":"SV001","repositoryUrl":"https://example.com/edusubmit.git"}

### MSSV rỗng -> 400
POST {{api}}/api/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{"assignmentId":1,"studentCode":"","repositoryUrl":"https://example.com/edusubmit.git"}
